  "cues": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P001",
      "anchor": "In May 2006, Steve Jobs became Disney's largest individual shareholder. Not",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
        "became Disney's largest individual shareholder"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P007",
      "anchor": "By 2004, their talks about extending the relationship had broken down. Disn",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "By 2004"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P011",
      "anchor": "In 2005, Robert Iger became Disney's chief executive. Talks between the com",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
        "October twelfth"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P015",
      "anchor": "By January twelfth, 2006, the two sides had reached preliminary understandi",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
        "the exchange ratio"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "question",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P016",
      "anchor": "On January twenty-first, Jobs and Iger settled on a figure they were prepar",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "two point three Disney shares"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P017",
      "anchor": "This was an all-stock acquisition. Disney did not give every Pixar sharehol",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "twenty-three Disney shares"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P019",
      "anchor": "Now comes the twist that makes this deal different. Jobs was not just Pixar",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
        "just over half"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 0,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P020",
      "anchor": "He agreed to vote shares representing forty percent of Pixar's outstanding ",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "forty percent"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P022",
      "anchor": "On May fifth, 2006, the deal actually closed. Disney issued roughly 278 mil",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "On May fifth, 2006"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P023",
      "anchor": "Jobs' own filing gives the precise arithmetic. His 60 million and two Pixar",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "138 million and seven shares"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P024",
      "anchor": "He had gone from holding a majority of Pixar to holding a minority of Disne",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "reflective",
      "emphasis": [
        "stock-market value"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P027",
      "anchor": "Did Disney pay too much? The answer wasn't written into the contract. Pixar",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "skeptical",
      "emphasis": [
        "Did Disney pay too much?"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "question",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P029",
      "anchor": "The deeper reason the deal is so interesting is that Disney wasn't merely p",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "reflective",
      "emphasis": [
        "Disney empire"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P030",
      "anchor": "So the next time you see Toy Story under the Disney name, remember what els",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "reflective",
      "emphasis": [
